  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.8,
      "text": "What if Naruto joined the Akatsuki?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.4,
      "end": 3.84,
      "text": "The first surprise is that"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.84,
      "end": 5.28,
      "text": "joining would not make him safe."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.46,
      "end": 6.7,
      "text": "He carries the Nine Tails"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.7,
      "end": 9.0,
      "text": "and the Akatsuki wants the Tailed Beasts."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.56,
      "end": 11.28,
      "text": "Their new recruit is also their target."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.44,
      "end": 13.52,
      "text": "In this alternate timeline, Naruto"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 14.36,
      "text": "offers a deal."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.84,
      "end": 16.48,
      "text": "His help in exchange for"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.48,
      "end": 17.44,
      "text": "protecting his friends."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.68,
      "end": 18.92,
      "text": "At first, the missions give"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.92,
      "end": 20.58,
      "text": "him the respect he always wanted."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.04,
      "end": 22.7,
      "text": "But every favor comes with a price."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.86,
      "end": 24.58,
      "text": "The breaking point arrives when"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.58,
      "end": 26.18,
      "text": "his new allies demand that"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 27.54,
      "text": "he turn against the Hidden Leaf."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.58,
      "end": 28.26,
      "text": "He refuses."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.26,
      "end": 30.52,
      "text": "Now, both sides question his"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.52,
      "end": 32.0,
      "text": "loyalty, and the deal that"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.0,
      "end": 33.68,
      "text": "protected his friends falls apart."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.98,
      "end": 35.26,
      "text": "Naruto has to choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.64,
      "end": 37.22,
      "text": "Prove himself to the organization,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.8,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "or protect the people who"
    },
    {
